#: ../../chapter3.rst:3
msgid "Browser Requirements"
msgstr "Browserkrav"

#: ../../chapter3.rst:5
msgid ""
"The web portal runs inside compatible web browsers. We recommend using "
"the following web browsers."
msgstr "Webportalen kører inden i kompatible webbrowsere. Vi anbefaler at bruge følgende webbrowsere."

#: ../../chapter3.rst:8
msgid "Google Chrome (Latest)"
msgstr "Google Chrome (Seneste)"

#: ../../chapter3.rst:9
msgid "Firefox (Latest)"
msgstr "Firefox (Seneste)"

#: ../../chapter3.rst:10
msgid "Safari (Latest)"
msgstr "Safari (Seneste)"

#: ../../chapter3.rst:11
msgid "Windows Edge (Latest)"
msgstr "Windows Edge (Seneste)"

#: ../../chapter3.rst:12
msgid "Opera (Latest)"
msgstr "Opera (Seneste)"

#: ../../chapter3.rst:13
msgid "Internet Explorer (11)"
msgstr "Internet Explorer (11)"

#: ../../chapter3.rst:18
msgid ""
"For administration work, the Web Portal doesn't support Internet Explorer"
" 8 any more."
msgstr "Til administrationsarbejde understøtter Webportalen ikke længere Internet Explorer 8."

#: ../../chapter3.rst:23
msgid ""
"Google Chrome and Firefox have self-update features so most of the time "
"you are running the latest version. It is OK if these web browser are not"
" the latest versions, as long as they were released after 2011."
msgstr "Google Chrome og Firefox har funktioner til selvopdatering, så det meste af tiden kører du den nyeste version. Det er i orden, hvis disse webbrowsere ikke er de nyeste versioner, så længe de er udgivet efter 2011."

#: ../../chapter3.rst:28
msgid ""
"For the best user experience, however, we recommend the latest version of"
" web browsers."
msgstr "For at opnå den bedste brugeroplevelse anbefaler vi dog den nyeste version af webbrowsere."

